{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "23d3ea2ee4bc15fce194797d69080c194b9b509f3472a32e23d0474be3840877", "ja": "まずは、レッスン風景", "zh": "首先是练习的场景", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c79041053d2df95741b7811d1e4db858ee90b49daf083c30c495df64c1177db5", "ja": "記念公演で流すための、ドキュメンタリー\nのVTRを撮影する事になった765プロ。\nレッスン中の亜美、茜、亜利沙、杏奈の元に\nプロデューサーのカメラが入る。アイドル達\nの気になる日常を、少しだけ覗いてみよう！", "zh": "为了拍摄在纪念公演上播放的纪录片\n影像，765制作人开始了拍摄工作。\n制作人的摄像机来到了正在练习的亚美、茜、亚利沙和杏奈身边。\n让我们稍微窥探一下偶像们令人好奇的日常吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1023_null", "source_sha256": "3ca1a312b51a374d94be08935ef1e265f47aed23675070239fa6b4f8f1cbad60", "ja": "このVTRでは、記念公演までのアイドル達を追い、\nそれぞれの『輝き』について、回答してもらった……。", "zh": "这段VTR记录了偶像们直到纪念公演前的经历，并请她们回答了各自的『光芒』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "86e429e68c37c941361ea7443f089f6439da8e37c04585dae2a7423eada64fdc", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……、\n{$P$}ちゃん、聞こえますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n{$P$}，听得见吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "1aa1d8d6e7d24c7fa2ce452cea37b3b789f8ecedf30013f5bc48bc1b3456da2c", "ja": "今、あなたの心に直接呼びかけています……。", "zh": "现在，我正在直接对你的内心说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "9ac96b14aff26e80e30b7db5e9b07740f8874f18f6c8a59be903017129c2ca4c", "ja": "……。\nしっかり声、出てるよ……茜さん……。", "zh": "……。\n声音清清楚楚传出来了哦……茜小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "fff7f6a2b87443da27e65342b7bf9032bf974edafc68617a41802dd8ffc8a4a0", "ja": "あなたがこの映像を見ているということは、\n亜美はあの世にはいないでしょう……。", "zh": "如果你正在看这段影像，那就说明亚美应该已经不在那个世界了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "532f46988014b6c1681fd73f207e58a7c947c54273c82b32dae8f35d43168d91", "ja": "ええっ！　すぐ生き返ってください！　ファンサうちわ\nの「長生きして！」が無駄になっちゃいますよぉ！", "zh": "诶？！请马上复活啊！不然粉丝互动扇上的“请长命百岁！”就要白写了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1005_null", "source_sha256": "8a76f235850369d31637edccdbb974246302397c67b865d6dcf77139d447adc8", "ja": "まだまだアイドル達の間に、緊張感はない。\nいつものレッスンと同じように、賑やかにしている。", "zh": "偶像们之间还完全没有紧张感。\n就像平时练习时一样，热闹非凡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "5cba52aef2b34272832b28aa69ea4daf8faedcc0619e64d274d00618c2682682", "ja": "いつもとちょっと違うのは、今日はなんと！\nカメラがまわってるんですよ～！", "zh": "和平时稍微有点不同的是，今天居然！\n有摄像机在拍哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "b4e3cf465f04f850f2092fbcaeececfcb6b04d83aa68c1b7544db3c1c149fafd", "ja": "このメンバーだと……今日は、\n騒がしいレッスンになる、かも……。", "zh": "和这些成员一起的话……今天的练习，可能会很吵闹……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1008_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "2ef671f9008135e2d4c17d724d7e2bb42a7e427da40b1da504f4f3d6485270ac", "ja": "輝き……ハッ！？　まさか、イタズラ用に\n買っておいた、強力発光ボールペンのことを？", "zh": "闪耀……哈！？难道是指我为了恶作剧买的那支强力发光圆珠笔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "6d98c67f2a5972bf1d958a14e0bf3ba6c0b59f833f641a73d14624d4e7215551", "ja": "んっふっふ～。亜美のイタズラにそんなに\n期待してるなんて……おヌシも好きよのう～♪", "zh": "嗯呵呵～没想到你竟然这么期待\n亚美的恶作剧……阁下也挺乐在其中的嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1011_null", "source_sha256": "fe3c1aacf5e1444703fcd24de9d429539222717171819e164d4687a365b1a113", "ja": "安全を考慮し、ボールペンは\nスタッフが後で預かることに。", "zh": "出于安全考虑，圆珠笔\n之后将由工作人员代为保管。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "728d27a0b3e67e5611a98d872d38c7f52421f1154abf986b282eee6cc59b77a4", "ja": "茜ちゃんの輝き……マルチな才能にあふれた\n茜ちゃんだから、一言で言い表すのは難しいけど……。", "zh": "小茜的光辉……因为是充满多方面才能的小茜，很难用一句话概括，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "4aac29fcc1567462671347e946f948e8a9ab3c563e250855d4ef4d1bb4669d29", "ja": "あえて言うなら……この茜ちゃんスマイルかな♪\nみんなも釣られて笑顔になること間違いナシ！", "zh": "硬要说的话……就是这个小茜笑容吧♪\n保证大家也会被带动得笑容满面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "85395b11c93892a88826d43da8d35559ef88ac7861b3bd2df9ef6221667db8e7", "ja": "あ、アイドルとしての輝き……！　ありさ、\n本当に輝けてるのか自信はないですケド……。", "zh": "啊、作为偶像的光芒……！　亚利纱虽然不太确信自己真的在闪耀……俺去也", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "b3532b7d17a8a120d13291eb7c113622a1385803e87838b907d7f783d907d511", "ja": "……でも、アイドルちゃんが好きって気持ちだけは、\nこんなありさの中でもキラキラに輝いていますっ！", "zh": "……不过，喜欢偶像的那份心情，\n在这样的亚利沙心中也是闪闪发亮的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "ed0b4a6caad95ff8e73a163200f92ba9e8e16799dbb5f1e9f7d8cd337c05f8b1", "ja": "輝き……。いつもの杏奈、お話とか……下手っぴ\nだけど。スイッチ入ると……頑張れ、ます。", "zh": "闪耀……。平时的杏奈，不太擅长说话什么的……可是。一旦进入状态……就能努力……的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "736d49429542aa7856f6ab21d4fffa37368710021fd395d6f690fd2e1ef16b19", "ja": "応援してくれる人がいるから……ビビッとアイドルに\nなれる……それが、杏奈の……輝き、かな……？", "zh": "因为有人在为我加油……我才能变成超有活力的偶像……这或许就是，杏奈的……光芒，吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "e46b3412f973eee1679333597df27a43446e9f9bd866a6bb107e0053ff2dfa15", "ja": "おお～、なんかそれっぽくなったね♪\nんじゃ、最後にみんなでアピっとこ！　せーのっ！", "zh": "哦哦～感觉越来越像样了呢♪  \n那最后，大家一起宣传一下吧！预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "160e7ddda61c5f6da4042fc8c71d7d8db704c035001bb1d560f6174dac59a26e", "ja": "記念公演、よろしく頼むよ、君！", "zh": "纪念公演，就拜托你啦，君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "d41e9e3564ba4e09197f23c7f5f49f0342148ddb5a3f60c1b035b5c1ce0e1fa5", "ja": "記念公演、よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "纪念公演就拜托啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "d54b6114e7ba1af2eb90763c9aac3dee147d162eb80f0a015139ce1eaf1b7611", "ja": "記念公演、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "纪念公演，拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_01_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "aa55661d9d0ec5130de62ed7c72f5dd26e5ea17f91450c06e908cc45b10f41b4", "ja": "記念公演、よろしくお願いします……♪", "zh": "纪念公演，请多关照……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
